Lets undergo another revision. Rename WORKREQUEST to WORKORDER. WORKORDER should be a stream with the following shape: (STREAM) WORKORDER 
- repo
- URL
- ticket_name
- instructions
- model 

AGENTHANDLER:GUID should still be a hash, but now has this shape:
- work_order_id
- status
- error 

work_order_id is the stream-id from the WORKORDER stream. AgentHandler should use that reference to 
get the ticket-name, instructions, and model directly from the WORKORDER. When finished, it should 
publish to the stream FINISHED:REPO. FINISHED:REPO should be shaped: 

(HASH) FINISHED:REPO
- ticket_name
- ticket_id
- finished_at
- wt 
- agent_dir

